{"full":"Surething-io/cockpit","name":"cockpit","description":"OpenCockpit — the open Claude Code GUI for any LLM (Claude, Codex, DeepSeek, GLM, Kimi, Ollama). Cockpit IDE: parallel projects, terminal, browser & DB bubbles, code review. Self-host, local-first, MIT.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":41,"forks":12,"created":"2026-02-06T13:15:02Z","updated":"2026-10-01T09:02:09Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://opencockpit.dev","topics":["agent-sdk","ai-agent","ai-code-review","ai-coding","ai-coding-agent","ai-ide","ai-pair-programming","anthropic","any-llm","claude-agent-sdk","claude-code","claude-code-desktop","claude-code-gui","coding-agent","cursor-alternative","deepseek","developer-tools","glm","kimi","ollama"],"demo":"https://opencockpit.dev/try","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:44:41.747Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:44:41.747Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:44:41.747Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:51.190Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:17:54.156Z","stars":40,"forks":12},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:48.465Z","stars":40,"forks":12},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:44:41.747Z","stars":41,"forks":12}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["OpenCockpit is the open Claude Code GUI for any LLM — an IDE-like workbench for the whole dev loop. Run multi-project Claude sessions out of the box; pop open a tab for Codex, DeepSeek, GLM, Kimi, or local Ollama whenever you need, side by side, with no environment variables to edit. Built-in terminal, Chrome control, PostgreSQL / MySQL / Redis bubbles, code review, and slash modes — all local. And it's web client–server: self-host it on a shared dev box and every teammate gets a seat.","Anthropic ships Claude Code as a CLI. That's the right call for power users — but the moment you have more than one project in flight, your terminal turns into mission control with no instruments.","Cockpit is the instrument panel. It does not replace Claude Code; it stands on top of the official Agent SDK and gives you the things a CLI can't:"],"features":["Claude (default) — full official Agent SDK; zero setup if claude CLI is already configured","Codex — reuses your /.codex config; same chat, same shell + bubbles","DeepSeek — DeepSeek key + live model picker (deepseek-v4-pro by default) and a balance check","GLM (Zhipu / BigModel) — BigModel key + live model picker (glm-5.2 by default) and a Coding Plan quota check; one key, two hosts — switch Region between open.bigmodel.cn and api.z.ai","Kimi (Moonshot) — Kimi Code key + live model picker (kimi-for-coding, k3, …) and a quota check; no kimi CLI needed"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Surething-io/cockpit/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"279ba422cd5d13fa4e620f546e03b68f69dcccddb1888c9685a9da936ed4f5a7","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:51.187Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T16:23:41.058Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"OpenCockpit is the open Claude Code GUI for any LLM — an IDE-like workbench for the whole dev loop. Run multi-project Claude sessions out of the box; pop open a tab for Codex, DeepSeek, GLM, Kimi, or local Ollama whenever you need, side by side, with no environment variables to edit. Built-in terminal, Chrome control, PostgreSQL / MySQL / Redis bubbles, code review, and slash modes — all local. And it's web client–server: self-host it on a shared dev box and every teammate gets a seat.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Surething-io/cockpit/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"And it's web client–server: self-host it on a shared dev box and every teammate gets a seat.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Surething-io/cockpit/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"Pick Opcode if you want a native desktop feel with checkpoints and cost analytics.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Surething-io/cockpit/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Team on a shared dev box: self-host one Cockpit where the code lives — every teammate opens a browser, takes a seat, and runs their own AI sessions in their own project / worktree.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Surething-io/cockpit/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Codex — log in once with codex login to populate /.codex","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Surething-io/cockpit/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"> There is no launchd/systemd integration: after a reboot, run cockpit start > again (or add it to your login items).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Surething-io/cockpit/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"279ba422cd5d13fa4e620f546e03b68f69dcccddb1888c9685a9da936ed4f5a7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Surething-io/cockpit/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T16:23:41.059Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T09:02:09Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T16:23:31.107Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Surething-io/cockpit/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T16:23:41.061Z","hash":"279ba422cd5d13fa4e620f546e03b68f69dcccddb1888c9685a9da936ed4f5a7","originalBytes":21067,"storedBytes":21067,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["cockpit","code","claude","browser","one","agent","any","session","install","review","run","api","bash","same","terminal","chat","key","kimi","npm","open","desktop","dev","engine","every","git","local","ollama","own","runs","cli","click","codex","deepseek","only","project","running","windows","bubbles","default","each","glm","model","back","bubble","context","name","opencockpit","picker","sdk","server","sessions","side","skills","tab","via","app","bots","call","chrome","credentials.json","directory","file","full","fully","map","never","output","pick","plan","read","setup","shell","slash","start","update","web","another"